@base = http://localhost:3100
@admin = COLLER_LE_TOKEN_ADMIN
@member = COLLER_LE_TOKEN_SARA

### Socle : 200
GET {{base}}/healthz

### MES 1 : 201 apres completion, 501 au depart
POST {{base}}/api/equipments
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"assetTag":" lap-099 ","name":" Portable demo ","category":"LAPTOP","dailyLateFeeCents":1000}

### MES 1 : repeter la creation precedente donne 409
POST {{base}}/api/equipments
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"assetTag":"LAP-099","name":"Portable demo","category":"LAPTOP","dailyLateFeeCents":1000}

### MES 1 : 403 pour un membre, une fois la MES completee
POST {{base}}/api/equipments
Authorization: Bearer {{member}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### MES 2 : 200 apres completion, 501 au depart
GET {{base}}/api/analytics/returned-loans/by-category
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

### MES 2 : 403, deja fourni
GET {{base}}/api/analytics/returned-loans/by-category
Authorization: Bearer {{member}}

